        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: '"The defrosting process was a complete failure. I must come back
          and reflect, and approach this differently next time. His body will be
          of no use to us now. It is unseen byt the Lord''s eyes, though hopefully
          our son rests well up above."'
